{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And he called to Rachel and to Leah.</b> To Rachel first and afterward to Leah, for she was the mistress of the house on whose account Jacob joined himself with Laban — and even the sons of Leah acknowledge this, for Boaz and his court, from the tribe of Judah, say: ״כְּרָחֵל וּכְלֵאָה אֲשֶׁר בָּנוּ שְׁתֵּיהֶן״ (Ruth 4:11) — they placed Rachel before Leah."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:01:25.884431736Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}